WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A student drags their chapter PDF into Kelus.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Kelus reads it, finds the topics and starts with the first one.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Quick checks written from lines in the chapter: two right, one slip.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The student explains it in their own words and compares with the page.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The result, then the plan: the missed line comes back first tomorrow.
